PNG_IMAGE_PLACEHOLDER
This is a placeholder for the 1024x1024 PNG version of the Zinga logo.
To generate this file, use the logo.svg file and convert it to PNG at 1024x1024 resolution.

Command to generate:
  convert -background none -density 300 logo.svg -resize 1024x1024 logo-1024.png

Or use an online SVG to PNG converter with:
  - Input: logo.svg
  - Size: 1024x1024
  - Background: Transparent
  - Quality: High
